# 换行符规约：仓库内统一 LF，避免 Windows/macOS/Linux 组员之间产生「整文件改动」的假 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.sql binary
